Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:17:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Decompile the shot types, shot spawning,
 invalidation and rendering

Spawning writes [flag]/[age] and [patnum]/[from_option] as single 16-bit
stores. In shot_b(), the level 8 option shot case falls through into the
level 9 one.
